     },
     "text": "I had a service that split my rent payments in two each month and the last month before my move out, the service drafted from my account for the month following my move out date.  When the monies were being returned they did not refund the complete amound.  I reach out to the office several times and got a run around and was told I would be called back by the office manager at the front of which he never called me back.  I tried getting ahold of someone from corporate but that did not help.  They kept monies owed to me in the form of a deposit as I reconditioned the apartment better than I found it.  I was told they needed a cleaning fee and to repaint the apartment due to drywall s**** holes in which were patched.  According to my lease agreement this was acceptable for a deposit return and the walls were spottless otherwise.  Video evidence and pictures upon request."
    }
